  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 招你來hip相kah唸詩"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">招你來hip相kah唸詩</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 陳秀枝</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh1GS3Po1cVy9TEF55HFHO2u4thhbMAgUw9RN3YanbdbXUIaXPGMRVIGDG4914vx4TxXkCr7ln9chnn2UnqcjYdh1hZfFWSfLD0xIPtdaAlk0coGlYUfk-TVlyImXF3U6WpLKFTU2U3eXqxTWTifh7WLszbs05mL7UrZmnMZgwn3mCJd81jJHH-Z-_8wne0\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\n        寒--人ê下晡時<br />溪邊ê石頭　hō͘日頭照kah khah光生（kng-siⁿ）</span><span style=\"font-size: xx-small;\">1</span><br />淡薄仔燒lō　bē koh寒sih-sih<br />野鳥仔thián開翼　來溪邊揣食si̍t<br />彎彎oat-oat　飛來飛去<br />Mā beh揣一搭thang唸詩<br />Ta-lian ê落葉滴落水面sih--啊sih<br />一痕一痕ê水iann湠--出-去<br />野鳥用目睭hip kah笑bi-bi<br /><br />我tī溪--裡藏水bī<br />Hō͘野鳥叫是伊ê朋友兄弟<br />Tī心內恬恬仔hoah：<br />\t我beh招你來hip相kah唸詩\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"tg-annotations\" style=\"border-top-color: rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; color: #666666; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 60px; padding: 15px 10px 0px;\">1   Tī chia是講石頭hō͘日頭照了，khah光滑。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjrKYoXj_wJUTBPNsu8d3MYYKNtLRX5xKPGaZn5mDxlhszDdwK5pfUju_FzwHQyamnz6XfIfoltdTkXQxs0L0IB-lOe4XUsmJ_gEfjJp1DMrMlC0ipugio_S0ObqohWlgLov0Bc07xLvv1qnED4d0IdAxEEgIsBXmUKlKQuB7DFec3bMDJhXZQkORLsl94N\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 382期，2026年01月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
